comments.body:
@Matt Stevens thank you for the fantastic article, it really highlights beautifully the talented artists and creators that make up the Hollywood production community. I’ve been to the Warner Bros lot, it is a magical and historic place. 

It’s hard to believe that David Ellison can so easily threaten these generational livelihoods with his off the cuff remarks about leaving Hollywood. I hope that never happens. 

I’ve always been curious about the food in these shows, are those styled pancakes real, haha?
